<title>AUSTRALIA: Queensland Sugar appoints bulk terminals chief.</title>
<headline>Queensland Sugar appoints bulk terminals chief.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Queensland Sugar Corp (QSC) said it had appointed David Quemard as general manager bulk sugar terminals, with responsibility for managing the group's bulk sugar terminal network.</p>
<p>Quemard has more than 15 years experience in the coal industry, a QSC statement said.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
